            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. The University shall determine when clean-up time is necessary for employees. If the University determines that such clean-up time is necessary, a maximum of ten (10) minutes of clean-up time prior to the employee's meal period and/or at the end of each shift shall be granted and considered as time worked.",
